abstract: >-
  Draft proposal by a Gonka community member, not an official position of Gonka or its Core Team: per-address
  compensation register under three options after the WGNK bridge hack of 18 November 2026, with the raw on-chain data,
  the calculation code, a critique of the method and three independent reviews. Prepared with Claude Code (Fable 5.2).
